# Rescuing Lyra from the Observatory (Milestone 20c, any other start). Plays on
# reaching Lyra's rune after the Void Archmage is beaten.

face player up
emote lyra !
say Lyra: The Archmage is gone? Then the void it was drinking in has nowhere left to go. Good.
say Lyra: It was studying me. Every spell I cast, it tried to swallow. I think it wanted to learn how the light works.
say Lyra: Frank sent you? Then the others are still out there somewhere.
emote lyra note
say Lyra: Count me in. Fire, frost, lightning, stone - point me at whatever's next.
join lyra
despawn lyra
sound level_up
narrate Lyra joins the party!
set cleared_observatory
